.TH STARDECK 1 "2026" "StarDeck 0.1.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
stardeck \- virtual planetarium (stars, constellations, planets, Sun and Moon)
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B stardeck
[\fB\-\-time\fR \fIYYYY-MM-DD[ HH:MM]\fR] [\fB\-\-lat\fR \fIDEG\fR] [\fB\-\-lon\fR \fIDEG\fR] [\fB\-\-view\fR \fIAZ,ALT[,FOV]\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-splash\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Shows the sky for any date and place: about 5000 stars, constellation figures, Messier and bright NGC objects, the Milky Way, the Sun, the Moon
with its phase and the planets.
